{"id":"en_nowhere-to-belong","title":"Nowhere to Belong","titleEn":"Nowhere to Belong","description":"A woman discovers her status as an outsider in her own family after stumbling onto a WeChat group chat her cousin left open on her computer. A notification announces a family dinner celebrating her younger brother Haohao's improved exam results, and when she clicks into the conversation, she finds the group contains only four members: her father, her mother, her brother, and her cousin. Her brother's reply makes the exclusion explicit, stating that only the four of them should attend and that Song Ximeng should not be invited, adding that she is petty and once fought with their cousin over a single apple. The discovery leaves her frozen, confirming what she had long sensed about her place in the family.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/nowhere-to-belong/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/nowhere-to-belong/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Weak to Strong","Melodrama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du4iu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_nowhere-to-belong_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du4iu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_nowhere-to-belong_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du4iu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_nowhere-to-belong_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du4iu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_nowhere-to-belong_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,